          {
            "title": "Adding strings",
            "id": 78795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo imparato che possiamo usare <code>+</code> per concatenare due stringhe e visualizzarle insieme.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;new&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo imparato che possiamo usare <code>+</code> per concatenare due stringhe e visualizzarle insieme.</p><p>Unisci le due stringhe in modo che la console mostri <code>new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;new&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Adding numbers and strings",
            "id": 78796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuttavia, usare <code>+</code> per combinare dati numerici come <code>2</code> e <code>\" new messages\"</code> produce un <strong>errore</strong>, perché sono tipi di valori diversi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; new messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/default/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(2 + &quot; new messages&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'int' and 'str'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>, seguito da <code>\" new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combinare dati numerici e stringhe con <code>+</code> produce un <strong>errore</strong> perché sono tipi di valore diversi.</p><p>Metti il numero <code>2</code> a sinistra e il testo <code> new messages</code> a destra per generare quell'errore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; new messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/default/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(2 + &quot; new messages&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'int' and 'str'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>\" new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le f-string, abbreviazione di stringhe formattate, ci permettono di visualizzare espressioni come l'aggiunta di una stringa a un numero senza generare errori.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>f\"{2} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le f-string, abbreviazione di stringhe formattate, ti permettono di visualizzare insieme numeri e testo.</p><p>Inizia con <code>f</code> prima delle virgolette. Inserisci il numero tra parentesi graffe, come <code>{2}</code>.</p><p>Completa la riga con una f-string in modo che la console visualizzi <code>2 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{2} new messages&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"f&quot;{2 new messages}&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>f\"{2} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
