            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserire variabili come <code>new_messages</code> tra le parentesi graffe ne visualizza anche il valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_messages = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new_messages}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new_messages</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserire variabili come <code>new_messages</code> tra le parentesi graffe ne visualizza anche il valore.</p><p>Inserisci la variabile tra le parentesi graffe in modo che la console mostri <code>2 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_messages = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new_messages}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;new_messages&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new_messages</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
