          {
            "title": "Expressions",
            "id": 80749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare espressioni come <code>new - read</code> tra le parentesi graffe per visualizzarne il valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"read = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new - read}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" unread messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3 unread messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>new - read</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare le parentesi graffe per inserire valori tutte le volte che vogliamo all'interno della f-string. Ecco come con <code>5</code> e poi con <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages and \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" friend requests&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages and 2 friend requests\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>5</code>, seguito da <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare le parentesi graffe per inserire valori tutte le volte che vogliamo all'interno della f-string.</p><p>Completa le parentesi graffe in modo che la console mostri <code>5 new messages and 2 friend requests</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages and \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" friend requests&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages and 2 friend requests\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>5</code>, seguito da <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
