          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 82107,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per riutilizzare una f-string, possiamo salvarla in una variabile, come qui con <code>status</code> e <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>status</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per riutilizzare una f-string, possiamo salvarla in una variabile, come qui con <code>status</code>.</p><p>Memorizza la f-string in <code>status</code> in modo che, stampandola, venga mostrato <code>5 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{new} new messages&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>status</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
